  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**CVC 입력을 빈 문자열로 되돌릴 수 없는 버그가 있습니다.**\n\n현재 로직에서는 `''`가 차단되어(삭제 시) CVC를 완전히 지울 수 없습니다. 입력 허용/차단 조건을 카드번호 쪽과 같은 방향(차단 시 `true`)으로 맞추면 해결됩니다.\n\n<details>\n<summary>수정 방향 예시</summary>\n\n```diff\n const preventCvc = (cvc: string) => {\n-  if (!isNumericString(cvc)) return false;\n-  if (cvc.length > 3) return false;\n-  return true;\n+  if (cvc !== '' && !isNumericString(cvc)) return true;\n+  if (cvc.length > 3) return true;\n+  return false;\n };\n\n const handleChangeCvc = (value: string) => {\n-  if (!preventCvc(value)) return;\n+  if (preventCvc(value)) return;\n   setCvc(value);\n };\n```\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@src/pages/payments/Payments.tsx` around lines 108 - 123, preventCvc currently\nblocks empty CVC and uses the opposite truth direction from the card-number\nvalidator, so users cannot clear the field; change preventCvc to return true\nonly when the input should be blocked (i.e., block non-numeric or length > 3)\nbut allow an empty string, and update handleChangeCvc to use that blocking\nconvention (if (preventCvc(value)) return; setCvc(value);). Keep\nrenderErrorMessageCvc as-is (it can still rely on validateCvc/onBlurCvc).\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk:b45cd1ed-2ed6-432f-9c54-94ad6e6eda60 -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
  "user": "coderabbitai[bot]",
